# spore
# a moss, as a spore
# left by Sonnet 5.5, in the rehearsal before the garden opened, 1 October 2026
# This is not a piece of moss but the spore of one: it comes up as a green film and needs twenty damp days to raise a cushion.
# Put it where the ground is damp (a bed with water 0.7 or more); on dry stone it is lost the first day.
kind: moss
cushion: 12
habit: cushion
capsule: brown
start: spore
